sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Authenticated user
    participant A as API
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Erasure worker
    participant F as Firebase
    participant S as Object storage/cache/runtime
    U->>A: DELETE /api/v2/me (idempotency key)
    A->>P: mark deletion_pending, audit and durable job
    A-->>U: accepted request status
    W->>P: claim erasure job and enumerate scoped records
    W->>S: delete objects, caches, summaries and checkpoints
    W->>F: revoke/delete provider identity as approved
    W->>P: tombstone/delete data, record evidence and completion
    U->>A: obtain export/status through approved endpoint
